Practical Explanation

This project uses the Scapy library for packet capturing and analysis.

from scapy.all import sniff, get_if_list

Scapy provides several useful functions:
Get available network interfaces
get_if_list()

Capture live packets
sniff()

Display packet summary
packet.summary()

Check protocol type
packet.haslayer("TCP")

Retrieve source and destination IP addresses
packet["IP"].src
packet["IP"].dst

Retrieve source and destination port numbers
packet["TCP"].sport
packet["TCP"].dport

Scapy is a powerful library because it allows easy access to different packet layers and provides detailed packet analysis with very little code.
